      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your brain is calmly organizing and consolidating daytime memories and thoughts during sleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your brain is calmly organizing and consolidating daytime memories and thoughts during sleep."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日中の出来事や思考を、脳が睡眠中に静かに整理・定着させている安定した状態です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your current sleep rhythm looks balanced. Keep maintaining a consistent bedtime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your current sleep rhythm looks balanced. Keep maintaining a consistent bedtime."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在の睡眠リズムは良好です。このまま規則正しい就寝時間を保ちましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your desire for fun, fresh stimulation, and stepping away from daily routines is rising.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your desire for fun, fresh stimulation, and stepping away from daily routines is rising."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日常の枠から離れて、楽しさや新しい刺激・開放感を味わいたいという欲求が高まっています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your feedback directly helps us improve the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いただいたご意見は今後のアップデート改善に活かします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your mind and body strongly crave sufficient sleep and relaxation. Fatigue may be accumulating.": {
